# diet-plan-final.md

**Version 4.0 — 7 November 2026.** Rebuilt from the clients' meal-by-meal interview of 7 Nov. Every number in this file is computed from one food table (`data/foods.py`) and one plan file (`data/plan.py`) by `build.py`, not typed by hand. v4 starts with Tuesday 10 Nov dinner; the first full v4 Saturday trip is 14 Nov.

